    {
      "text": "It lives in the depths beyond the reach of sunlight. It flashes lights on its antennae to communicate with others of its kind.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its two antennae glow softly to lure in prey, making it a useful Pokémon for night fishing.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
